<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17804" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτομᾰτ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>act of oneself, act offhand</i> or <i>unadvisedly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				4.5.21
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be done spontaneously</i> or <i>at random,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ages.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Ti.</u>
				1.297
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>; but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ηὐτοματισμένη παράδοσις</span>”
				<i>haphazard,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hyp.</u>
					7.35
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ηὐτοματισμένως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>in Prm.</u>
					p.650S.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>introduce the agency of chance,</i> of Anaxagoras, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				327.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of things,
				<i>happen of themselves, casually,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
			</span></i>(<u>Sp.</u>)<i><span class="en">
				33
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φήμη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					16.92
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be self-produced,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.441
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> of natural
			agencies, <i>act spontaneously,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ αὐτοματιζούσης τῆς φύσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					715b27
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				20
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
